<title>USA: Midland Federal Q2 Dec 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Midland Federal Q2 Dec 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEVIEW, Ill. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.83   profit	 $0.46</p>
<p> Net profit		   293   profit	   162</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.08   profit	 $0.83</p>
<p> Net loss		  28,056   profit     290,451</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 includes one-time recovery of a prior period loss on the sale of real estate owned properties in the amount of $131,000 (after tax) or $0.37/shr.</p>
<p>1996 six-month includes after-tax charge of $445,000 or $1.26/shr for  Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization. Without this assessment, net income for the six-month period ended December 31, 1996 would have been $417,000 or $1.18/shr.</p>
<p>Midland Federal Sacings &amp; Loan Association.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
